# The gauntlet trees are deliberately tracked. Two lines here previously read
# "gauntlet-output gauntlet-universal" — space-separated, which git reads as one
# literal path that does not exist, so they never ignored anything and the
# directories were committed anyway. Removed rather than corrected: criteria.md,
# the feature tree, the specs, and the scorecards are project artifacts that
# other documents cite by path, and REMEDIATION-BRIEF.md is worked from directly.
